     m_sTitle "Briefing: Situation."
     m_sContent "I. Situation:"\
     "Germany, 1987."\
     "Local Time: Random"\
     "Weather: Random"\
     ""\
     "The 8th Guards Army has rolled over fulda in a day and the US V Corps has been reduced by half. We have taken bad orb and we are continuing towards Frankfurt."\
     "US forces are conducting a fighting retreat towards the city."\
     ""\
     "The 39th Guards Motor Rifle Regiment are fighting down the A66 highway and through the surrounding farmland. "\
     "Our Motor Rifle Company (330) under the 389th Motor Rifle Regiment, has conducted a flank around the South of an American mechanized infantry company, who are holding the village of Kassel, in the farmland on the Southern Approach to the highway."\
     ""\
     "Ia. Friendly Forces:"\
     "PLAYER UNIT (East of the AO):"\
     "1x Motorized Recon Company - (330)"\
     ""\
     "Ib. Enemy Forces:"\
