     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Briefing: Mission."
     m_sContent "II. Mission:"\
     "330 has been tasked with securing the approach to the A66 highway by destroying the US mechanized company defending the village of Kassel and the surrounding farmland."\
     "1. Clear the platoons between us and Kassel from their positions."\
     "2. Seize Kassel."\
     "3. Hold the route North of Kassel against any counterattack."\
     ""\
